# JUDGE-TESTS r0 Specification (Frozen)

## Operational Scope
- Evaluates base schema test instances against head schemas inside python audit harness (`audit.py`).
- Base PASS + Head FAIL  ==> Elevates Exit 4 (NOT EVALUATED) to Exit 1 (VIOLATED) with 1-minimal witness.
- Base PASS + Head PASS  ==> Retains Exit 4 (NOT EVALUATED) with diagnostic ("N base-valid tests pass").
- Static HOLDS verdicts  ==> 0 contradicted across 174 tested pairs.

